  "job_B21.1.1.2_20251003_114521": {
    "chunk_text": "rest acenned Sy\u00f0\u00f0an hy beo\u00f0 scearpe & \u00f0yrnihte, & heo hafa\u00f0 stelan hwitne o\u00f0\u00f0e grenne, on \u00f0\u00e6s heahnysse \u00deeos wyrt by\u00fe cenned on feldon & on wi\u00f0err\u00e6don stowum. Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mig\u00fean astyrunge genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte \u00fee we eringius nemdun gecnucude, syle drincan Na \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feone mig\u00fean astyre\u00fe, ac eac swylce \u00f0a mono\u00felican & \u00f0\u00e6s inno\u00f0es astyrunge & & eac wi\u00f0 liferseocnysse & wi\u00f0 n\u00e6ddrena slitas heo wel frema\u00f0. Eac swylce wi\u00f0 m\u00e6nigfealde leahtras \u00fe\u00e6ra inno\u00f0a heo wel frema\u00f0 ge\u00feiged mid \u00fe\u00e6re wyrte s\u00e6de \u00fee Wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6ra breosta geswel genim \u00f0as ylcan wyrte to cly\u00fean geworhte, lege to \u00f0am breostan. Ealle \u00fea yfelan gegaderung\u00e6 onbutan \u00fea breost heo tofere\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 scorpiones stingc & wi\u00f0 ealra n\u00e6ddercynna slitas & eac wi\u00f0 wedehundes slite genim \u00feas ylcan Eac swylce \u00feeos sylfe wyrt wi\u00f0 oman wel frema\u00fe on \u00feas ylcan wisan gemetegud. & eac heo fotadle geli\u00f0iga\u00f0 gyf hy man \u00e6t frym\u00fee to gelege\u00fe. \u00d0as wyrte man philantropos nemne\u00fe, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on ure \u00feeode menlufigende, for \u00f0y heo wyle hr\u00e6dlice \u00dea man eac o\u00ferum naman clate nemne\u00f0, & heo of hyre manega bogas asende\u00fe, & \u00fea lange & Wi\u00f0 n\u00e6d",
